# No Cursor attribution in git

Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Made-with: Cursor`, or any Cursor/agent attribution trailer to commits, pull requests, or code comments.

When committing, use only the subject/body you write. Do not pass `--trailer` for Cursor. If a trailer still appears, strip it before pushing (the repo `commit-msg` hook should remove it).
